  "user_message": "We have a launch deadline in 6 months. At our current rate of development, we are likely to miss that deadline by over a month. We need to bring in additional development capacity or technical leadership to help accelerate the team's progress. We're not sure which to do. What information do I need to make this decision effectively?",
